攝衣謝之，延上坐。食其說沛公襲陳留，得秦積粟。乃以酈食其為廣野君，酈商為將，將陳留兵，與偕攻開封，開封未拔。西與秦將楊熊戰白馬，又戰曲遇東，大破之。楊熊走之滎陽，二世使使者斬以徇。南攻潁陽，屠之。因張良遂略韓地轘轅。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m019-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m019-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"彭越","kind":"person","person_id":"9qt_orl_5f2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m019-0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"剛武侯","kind":"person","person_id":"ula_wqu_naa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m019-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"皇欣","kind":"person","person_id":"r9t_e2f_if5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m019-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"武蒲","kind":"person","person_id":"nqa_zlk_uu4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m019-0073","start":73,"end":76,"surface":"酈食其","kind":"person","person_id":"eya_qj3_tev","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m019-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m019-0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m019-0112","start":112,"end":114,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m019-0119","start":119,"end":122,"surface":"兩女子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、假稱或同名指代待覆核；不據字串補姓名或實際爵位。"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m019-0125","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"酈生","kind":"person","person_id":"eya_qj3_tev","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m019-0155","start":155,"end":157,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"cont